//! www.civila.com/Profesionales/TODOBOLSA/formulas.htm, 7 May 2001; research drive MetaStock/@Systems &
//! Indicators/Civila Formulas and Systems/DBZ_CivilaFormulasMeta.pdf, 148 pp.). Book id `mscvl`.
//! Its system tests are reprints from the MetaStock mailing list / Equis Traders' Tips that the vault already
//! holds from the Guppy formula index (dgmf), so every entry here is catalogued with its printed rules and a
//! pointer to the vault entry; none is re-implemented. Page refs = PDF page. Checks: library/mscvl/.
use crate::books::msws::{Book, Exec, Sys, EXEC_DEFAULT};
